            "name": "JavaScriptInProcessPool",
            "full_name": "TypeScriptActionInterface::JavaScriptInProcessPool",
            "namespace_path": "TypeScriptActionInterface",
            "description": "In-process pool of JavaScriptProgram instances for concurrent access\n\nThis class manages a pool of identical JavaScriptProgram instances that allows concurrent thread access without IPC overhead. Programs are created on demand when all existing programs are busy, up to an optional maximum size. When the maximum is reached, threads wait for a program to become available.",
